750.100 - Dented cans (11 total) were observed on shelves available for purchase. Products included the following:
Armour Vienna chicken bites (1 can; 10oz);
Bush's country style baked beans (1 cans; 20oz);
Family Gourmet apple pie filling (3 cans; 20oz);
Campbell's chicken noodle soup (2 cans 14.75oz);
Campbell's tomato soup (1 can 15.2oz)
Rotel iced tomatoes and chilies (1 can; 10oz);
Family Gourmet chicken and rice soup (1 can; 10.5oz);   and
Family Gourmet pear halves (1 can; 15oz).
All cans were removed from the shelves and set aside for inventory/discard.

Food shall be in sound condition, free from spoilage, filth, and other contamination and shall be safe for human consumption.
**Cans that are dented on the top, bottom or side seams, severely dented on any surface of the can, bulging, rusty, or questionable in any way must not be stocked for sale. Refuse questionable products when shipments are received and/or set aside products for credit when discovered. Cans that are damaged accidentally after being stocked on shelves must be removed from the sales area and set aside to be credited/disposed of properly.**
